5
00:00:16,452 --> 00:00:17,871
Or are you gonna hit on Fuse?

6
00:00:18,238 --> 00:00:19,498
Can I?

7
00:00:20,001 --> 00:00:22,001
Ayy.

8
00:00:23,911 --> 00:00:25,449
Didn't you get a tattoo for other people to look at?

9
00:00:25,473 --> 00:00:26,473
The reason I got it...

10
00:00:26,662 --> 00:00:27,662
is none of your business.

11
00:00:28,063 --> 00:00:29,063
Do you think...

12
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:31,270
someone can kiss a person that they aren't into?

13
00:00:31,918 --> 00:00:33,231
You can punch me.

14
00:00:34,202 --> 00:00:36,202
Because I feel really good.

15
00:02:38,633 --> 00:02:39,433
One, two.

16
00:02:39,466 --> 00:02:40,775
Three, four, five.

17
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,310
Six.
Seven, eight.

18
00:02:42,153 --> 00:02:43,153
Nine, ten.

19
00:02:43,343 --> 00:02:44,523
Like this.

20
00:02:44,947 --> 00:02:46,014
Who wants to try?

21
00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:47,142
Me, me.

22
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:49,266
Great, come here.

23
00:02:49,575 --> 00:02:50,575
Let's go.

24
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:51,400
Yeah.
Hey.

25
00:02:52,561 --> 00:02:54,061
Don't rush or force it.

26
00:02:54,784 --> 00:02:56,730
Find the right tempo.

27
00:02:56,873 --> 00:02:57,637
Tempo?

28
00:02:57,662 --> 00:02:58,662
Baby shark tempo.

29
00:02:59,491 --> 00:03:06,557
(Singing "Baby Shark".)

30
00:03:06,582 --> 00:03:08,316
He's still unconscious.

31
00:03:08,341 --> 00:03:10,741
I think I have to do rescue breathing.

32
00:03:24,179 --> 00:03:26,809
Only CPR is enough.

33
00:03:29,819 --> 00:03:31,619
Where did you go?

34
00:03:31,952 --> 00:03:33,752
I did some paperwork for Teacher Lookmee.

35
00:03:36,931 --> 00:03:38,062
Hey, lie down.

36
00:03:38,662 --> 00:03:39,162
Okay.
Next person.

37
00:03:42,245 --> 00:03:43,245
Are you feeling hot?

38
00:03:43,353 --> 00:03:45,729
Yeah. I also want to take a pee.

39
00:03:45,883 --> 00:03:47,229
The bathroom is even broken.

40
00:03:47,833 --> 00:03:51,683
Yeah, I have to use the bathroom on the second floor.

41
00:03:52,216 --> 00:03:54,579
You know what? On the second floor…

42
00:03:54,854 --> 00:03:56,581
a bathroom window is really huge.

43
00:03:56,806 --> 00:03:58,694
I saw someone kissing on other’s cheek.

44
00:04:04,727 --> 00:04:06,894
Fuse, you okay? I'll give you CPR.

45
00:04:08,602 --> 00:04:10,602
Great, do it like that.

46
00:04:16,555 --> 00:04:17,588
Did you tell anyone?

47
00:04:17,613 --> 00:04:18,413
I did.

48
00:04:18,636 --> 00:04:19,636
Hey.

49
00:04:26,237 --> 00:04:27,237
I told you.

50
00:04:32,022 --> 00:04:33,322
I mean someone else.

51
00:04:34,670 --> 00:04:36,046
If you don’t want me to tell others,

52
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:37,070
pay me.

53
00:04:57,270 --> 00:04:58,270
What do you want?

54
00:04:58,637 --> 00:04:59,782
I want the truth.

55
00:05:01,621 --> 00:05:02,777
About Tee and you.

56
00:05:11,670 --> 00:05:12,670
We’re friends.

57
00:05:14,361 --> 00:05:15,361
Friends?

58
00:05:16,186 --> 00:05:18,461
But I have never kissed your cheek.

59
00:05:21,537 --> 00:05:22,537
We’re friends.

60
00:05:23,470 --> 00:05:25,003
I haven’t broken up with Jeen yet.

61
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:28,270
It’s good that you know.

62
00:05:36,537 --> 00:05:38,437
If you don’t want any trouble,

63
00:05:38,837 --> 00:05:40,637
you should sort things out one by one.

64
00:05:41,903 --> 00:05:43,703
Think carefully before you do anything.

65
00:05:44,437 --> 00:05:45,603
But if you get stuck,

66
00:05:45,837 --> 00:05:46,837
let me know.

67
00:05:55,303 --> 00:05:56,103
- Hey.
- Hey.

68
00:05:56,298 --> 00:05:57,498
You’re playing without us?

69
00:05:57,637 --> 00:05:58,537
Yeah, you’re playing without me.

70
00:05:58,593 --> 00:06:00,526
Come here, be my team.

71
00:06:00,837 --> 00:06:02,007
Let’s tag team.

72
00:06:02,837 --> 00:06:04,070
Come on.

73
00:06:29,470 --> 00:06:32,503
Son, I know why you tripped.

74
00:06:32,970 --> 00:06:33,770
What?

75
00:06:33,908 --> 00:06:36,396
Because you kept looking at Fuse.

76
00:06:36,558 --> 00:06:38,803
Good thing Teacher Bangjong's cake didn't drop.

77
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:41,070
Or…

78
00:06:41,664 --> 00:06:43,179
Should I give Fuse a cake?

79
00:06:43,703 --> 00:06:45,270
Eh? Won’t you have it?

80
00:06:45,970 --> 00:06:47,536
I want to see him smiles to me.

81
00:06:47,650 --> 00:06:50,142
Damn. Go for it.

82
00:06:53,203 --> 00:06:54,513
Tee.

83
00:06:54,670 --> 00:06:56,103
Sorry, I'm hungry.

84
00:06:57,475 --> 00:06:59,042
Give yours to me then.

85
00:07:01,637 --> 00:07:02,803
What is mine,

86
00:07:03,503 --> 00:07:04,503
it is mine.

87
00:07:04,703 --> 00:07:05,703
Got it?

88
00:07:18,237 --> 00:07:19,237
Tee.

89
00:07:20,003 --> 00:07:21,437
Where are they rushing off to?

90
00:07:23,137 --> 00:07:25,037
Teacher Banjong’s cake is really tasty.

91
00:07:25,303 --> 00:07:26,303
Have you eaten it?

92
00:07:27,737 --> 00:07:28,737
Yeah.

93
00:07:30,137 --> 00:07:31,237
When did you eat it?

94
00:07:31,670 --> 00:07:33,303
It is still on the table.

95
00:07:37,470 --> 00:07:38,470
Tee.

96
00:07:39,361 --> 00:07:41,937
This cake is not only yours.

97
00:07:45,237 --> 00:07:46,797
No matter how much you want to keep it,

98
00:07:47,737 --> 00:07:49,270
if the owner comes to claim it,

99
00:07:49,937 --> 00:07:51,103
you have to return it.

100
00:07:51,703 --> 00:07:52,703
Got it?

101
00:08:05,184 --> 00:08:08,584
You mean Teacher Banjong will get the cake back?

102
00:08:25,041 --> 00:08:26,874
Frame isn't picking up my call at all.

103
00:08:27,642 --> 00:08:28,642
Yeah.

104
00:08:28,675 --> 00:08:29,775
He might be busy.

105
00:08:30,737 --> 00:08:32,003
What about going to Siam today?

106
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:33,870
Why?

107
00:08:34,598 --> 00:08:36,232
Because our school band performs today.

108
00:08:37,706 --> 00:08:39,106
Fuse, are you skipping a class?

109
00:08:39,131 --> 00:08:41,131
You kidding? It's you who skipped a class.

110
00:08:41,260 --> 00:08:43,894
I didn't. I'm practice for
the show at Siam this evening.

111
00:08:44,037 --> 00:08:45,157
Will you come to see a show?

112
00:08:49,322 --> 00:08:50,675
Ah.

113
00:08:51,337 --> 00:08:52,337
So, will you go?

114
00:08:52,937 --> 00:08:54,670
Nah, I have drum major practice.

115
00:08:56,322 --> 00:08:57,188
We'd better go.

116
00:08:57,256 --> 00:08:58,449
Go, let's go.

117
00:08:58,475 --> 00:08:59,599
Line up.

118
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:00,144
Go.

119
00:09:00,169 --> 00:09:01,169
Hmph.

120
00:09:02,136 --> 00:09:03,136
Forward, March.

121
00:09:56,127 --> 00:09:59,770
Shit, I think juniors stand us up.

122
00:10:02,389 --> 00:10:03,496
Hey, guys.

123
00:10:04,071 --> 00:10:05,365
Please split up to find them.

124
00:10:05,818 --> 00:10:07,340
Yeah, please help us.

125
00:10:14,651 --> 00:10:16,351
Sup. Where should I practice?

126
00:10:16,874 --> 00:10:18,974
Oh, you're coming for real?

127
00:10:21,784 --> 00:10:23,584
Eh? Why?

128
00:10:25,270 --> 00:10:27,050
I'm sorry.

129
00:10:28,019 --> 00:10:30,097
I forgot to tell you that you don't need to come.

130
00:10:30,638 --> 00:10:33,712
Uh… the first drum major is not free.

131
00:10:34,099 --> 00:10:35,820
I'll reschedule your practice later.

132
00:10:37,128 --> 00:10:39,148
Alright, it's fine.

133
00:10:39,503 --> 00:10:40,803
And don't feel down.

134
00:10:41,103 --> 00:10:42,203
Since you are already here,

135
00:10:43,070 --> 00:10:44,337
sit around and chill out.

136
00:10:45,703 --> 00:10:46,507
Fine.
Alright.

137
00:11:27,003 --> 00:11:28,303
Can I have some encouragement?

138
00:11:52,637 --> 00:11:54,003
Are you close to him?

139
00:11:56,603 --> 00:11:57,403
Nah.

140
00:11:57,437 --> 00:11:59,537
Nah? He was looking at you.

141
00:12:12,218 --> 00:12:14,218
(Fuse, where are you? I'm at your door.)

142
00:12:14,903 --> 00:12:16,703
What? Why did she go there?

143
00:12:19,303 --> 00:12:20,303
I gotta go.

144
00:12:20,579 --> 00:12:21,579
Okay.

145
00:12:38,870 --> 00:12:41,403
Hey, where did Fuse go?

146
00:12:42,308 --> 00:12:43,942
Uh… I don't know.

147
00:13:19,581 --> 00:13:20,748
I need to use the restroom.

148
00:13:22,534 --> 00:13:24,233
Then…

149
00:13:25,825 --> 00:13:26,825
I'll go with you.

150
00:13:27,681 --> 00:13:29,015
To help me carry it?

151
00:13:30,333 --> 00:13:31,333
To help you hold it.

152
00:13:32,205 --> 00:13:33,239
Don't you feel drained?

153
00:13:37,715 --> 00:13:40,481
Mr. Narongsak, please go to
examination room number four.

154
00:13:40,910 --> 00:13:41,910
Okay.

155
00:13:44,148 --> 00:13:45,981
Excuse me.

156
00:13:46,633 --> 00:13:48,567
Can I come with him?

157
00:13:49,348 --> 00:13:50,708
Are you a relative of the patient?

158
00:13:55,296 --> 00:13:56,296
I'm his boyfriend.

159
00:13:59,315 --> 00:14:00,415
I'm actually his boyfriend.

160
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:03,380
I'll kiss him as proof if you don't believe it.

161
00:14:05,422 --> 00:14:06,422
That's fine.

162
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:08,580
This way, please.

163
00:14:09,014 --> 00:14:10,014
Okay.

164
00:14:15,380 --> 00:14:16,380
Let's go.

165
00:14:19,608 --> 00:14:20,942
That hurts.

166
00:14:23,180 --> 00:14:24,180
Hey.

167
00:14:24,489 --> 00:14:25,778
What?

168
00:14:25,803 --> 00:14:27,586
I'm just holding it.

169
00:14:28,298 --> 00:14:29,498
Are you having dirty thoughts?

170
00:14:31,028 --> 00:14:32,094
Or do you want to do it?

171
00:14:33,518 --> 00:14:34,518
Stop it.

172
00:14:35,332 --> 00:14:36,332
Let's go.

173
00:14:41,514 --> 00:14:43,747
Fine, then I'll do it like a train.

174
00:14:45,218 --> 00:14:46,918
Choo-choo, okay?

175
00:15:00,814 --> 00:15:02,921
Yinwan, are you making a cake?

176
00:15:02,946 --> 00:15:06,409
Yes, since Mr. Tim said he wanted it.

177
00:15:06,815 --> 00:15:09,305
But I also made it for you.

178
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,866
Thank you.

179
00:15:12,366 --> 00:15:15,499
But you have to wait a sec.
Let me decorate it first.

180
00:15:15,947 --> 00:15:18,514
You can choose whatever you want.

181
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:22,780
What are you looking at?

182
00:15:24,547 --> 00:15:25,547
Uh.

183
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:26,980
I'm looking at the cake.

184
00:15:28,580 --> 00:15:29,580
It looks delicious.

185
00:15:34,014 --> 00:15:36,980
Well, can I do it myself?

186
00:15:37,780 --> 00:15:38,780
Of course.

187
00:16:21,747 --> 00:16:24,880
But… who did you make this cake for?

188
00:16:29,980 --> 00:16:31,580
He is a very adorable person.

189
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:43,580
Why do you have to dress so properly?

190
00:16:44,347 --> 00:16:47,680
I don't want him to find out
that I went back home to do it.

191
00:16:50,614 --> 00:16:51,614
You shy?

192
00:16:52,980 --> 00:16:53,980
That's cute.

193
00:16:54,414 --> 00:16:57,285
I bet he'll be so happy.

194
00:16:57,680 --> 00:16:58,680
Really?

195
00:17:00,114 --> 00:17:01,614
That's good if these make him happy.

196
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:04,081
Well, I have to go now.

197
00:17:04,156 --> 00:17:04,837
Okay.

198
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:05,880
Goodbye.

199
00:17:35,001 --> 00:17:36,001
Jeen.

200
00:17:37,034 --> 00:17:38,034
Fuse.

201
00:17:43,193 --> 00:17:44,433
Have you been here for a while?

202
00:17:45,495 --> 00:17:47,161
Why didn’t you tell me you were coming?

203
00:17:48,285 --> 00:17:51,085
If I told you, would you let me come?

204
00:17:53,232 --> 00:17:55,666
Right, are Pa and Ma at home?

205
00:17:58,390 --> 00:17:59,390
No.

206
00:18:01,036 --> 00:18:03,670
Well… can I come in and get some water?

207
00:18:46,418 --> 00:18:47,985
I’ll get you some water.

208
00:19:36,838 --> 00:19:37,838
Fuse.

209
00:19:39,685 --> 00:19:41,018
I think we need to talk.

210
00:19:46,985 --> 00:19:48,785
Why didn’t you reply my messages?

211
00:19:51,051 --> 00:19:52,531
And you don’t pick up my call either.

212
00:20:03,251 --> 00:20:04,491
Why don’t you play some sports?

213
00:20:04,651 --> 00:20:05,451
So cool.
I’m gonna leave.

214
00:20:06,419 --> 00:20:08,194
(Real time pics, bro.)
I have a dinner plan with my mom.

215
00:20:08,218 --> 00:20:09,218
I just saw Jeen.

216
00:20:09,485 --> 00:20:10,594
She walked with the same man.

217
00:20:10,618 --> 00:20:11,274
Where did you see them?
At BTS.

218
00:20:17,418 --> 00:20:18,951
You seems different these days.

219
00:20:20,451 --> 00:20:21,251
Are you okay?

220
00:20:21,351 --> 00:20:22,485
I think we should break up.

221
00:21:50,985 --> 00:21:52,051
What’s going on with you?

222
00:21:55,018 --> 00:21:56,285
Why have you changed this much?

223
00:21:59,285 --> 00:22:01,645
If there is something,
why can’t you just say it to my face?

224
00:22:05,479 --> 00:22:07,379
Am I still your girlfriend to you?

225
00:22:27,985 --> 00:22:29,018
Can we not break up?

226
00:22:34,251 --> 00:22:35,885
I love you so much, Fuse.

227
00:22:39,385 --> 00:22:41,151
I don’t want things to turn out this way.

228
00:22:46,218 --> 00:22:47,551
Do you still love me?

229
00:23:15,218 --> 00:23:16,218
I love you.

230
00:24:12,385 --> 00:24:13,418
Why, Fuse?

231
00:24:15,251 --> 00:24:16,385
We’re a couple.

232
00:24:22,618 --> 00:24:25,785
We’ve been fine without doing it.

233
00:24:29,485 --> 00:24:31,285
That’s why we’re not even like a couple.

234
00:24:36,423 --> 00:24:37,429
I know.

235
00:24:38,147 --> 00:24:40,315
You’re a gentleman.

236
00:24:41,343 --> 00:24:42,963
And you have always respected me.

237
00:24:44,805 --> 00:24:46,169
But I’m your girlfriend.

238
00:24:50,385 --> 00:24:51,818
If you love me,

239
00:24:53,218 --> 00:24:54,651
you must not push me away.

240
00:25:08,185 --> 00:25:10,051
There are only two of us now.

241
00:25:11,751 --> 00:25:14,618
You can do whatever you want to.

242
00:25:24,385 --> 00:25:25,385
Wanna try?

243
00:25:28,218 --> 00:25:30,485
I’d like to know how it feels too.

244
00:25:48,751 --> 00:25:50,485
But there are some of them who don’t punch.

245
00:25:51,951 --> 00:25:54,268
What if they don’t punch…

246
00:25:54,269 --> 00:25:56,018
because they also like it?

247
00:26:06,218 --> 00:26:07,485
I guess people like us,

248
00:26:08,551 --> 00:26:09,885
if we let some one kiss us,

249
00:26:10,418 --> 00:26:12,018
that person must be very special.

250
00:26:18,251 --> 00:26:20,385
Fuse, I bought you a cake.

251
00:26:33,785 --> 00:26:34,785
Shall we try?

252
00:26:36,119 --> 00:26:38,886
I just want to know how to do it.

253
00:26:40,285 --> 00:26:42,088
Don’t ask anyone to try this again.

254
00:26:42,475 --> 00:26:43,475
Okay?

255
00:26:48,618 --> 00:26:49,618
I'm sorry.

256
00:26:57,385 --> 00:26:58,385
Tee.

257
00:27:05,785 --> 00:27:07,385
I’m sorry for interrupting you.

258
00:27:23,066 --> 00:27:24,866
I’ll put it outside.

259
00:27:29,618 --> 00:27:32,785
But… who did you make this cake for?

260
00:27:34,251 --> 00:27:36,951
I bet he'll be so happy.

261
00:28:02,685 --> 00:28:03,685
Tee.

262
00:28:04,985 --> 00:28:05,985
Fuse.

263
00:28:27,551 --> 00:28:28,552
I’m leaving now.

264
00:28:31,458 --> 00:28:33,560
Too bad we got interrupted today.

265
00:28:34,529 --> 00:28:35,857
Let's try it again next time.

266
00:28:36,814 --> 00:28:39,176
Well, will your friend tease you about this tomorrow?

267
00:28:42,990 --> 00:28:44,123
Tell me when you arrived.

268
00:28:45,189 --> 00:28:46,523
Um, okay.

269
00:28:47,485 --> 00:28:48,485
Bye.

270
00:29:42,276 --> 00:29:43,843
Ah.

271
00:29:45,776 --> 00:29:46,776
Okay.

272
00:29:46,942 --> 00:29:47,742
Good job.

273
00:29:47,909 --> 00:29:48,909
You have taken it.

274
00:29:50,276 --> 00:29:51,276
It’s time for bed.

275
00:29:51,909 --> 00:29:52,909
Here.

276
00:29:53,175 --> 00:29:54,475
Lie down.

277
00:29:56,075 --> 00:29:57,641
Okay, pull the blanket up.

278
00:30:06,042 --> 00:30:07,642
Sleep. It’s already 8 PM.

279
00:30:15,290 --> 00:30:16,890
Who goes to sleep at 8 PM?

280
00:30:18,813 --> 00:30:19,813
Ah.

281
00:30:20,711 --> 00:30:21,711
Okay.

282
00:30:22,558 --> 00:30:26,658
If you don’t sleep at 8 PM, you’ll not recover.

283
00:30:26,983 --> 00:30:28,781
If you’re not recover,

284
